     A** AGENT CONTACT TYPE CODE TABLE FILE
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PAY01                     TEXT('AGENT CONTACT TYPE FILE')
     A            AYCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            AYTYPE         3A         COLHDG('CONTACT' 'TYPE')
     A            AYDESC    R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A            AYSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            AYUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            AYPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            AYTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            AYDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
